WEBVTT

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:12.582
Mmm... Hmm.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:13.666
Hmm.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:16.374
And how exactly will this help
us get Bonnie's attention?

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.749
Well, when they come back
from the sleepover...

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.416
- Careful. That tickles.
- ...she'll enter the room,

00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:23.874
see Forky and Karen Beverly,
and remember the wedding.

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:25.999
We are talking about Bonnie, right?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.291
And not Jessie?

00:00:27.292 --> 00:00:28.374
Huh? [chuckles]

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:31.207
Of course Bonnie. [chuckles] Just Bonnie.

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:32.832
Hey, what's everyone talking about?

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.749
Buzz is gonna propose to Jessie.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.291
- Propose?
- [Trixie] Finally.

00:00:36.292 --> 00:00:37.874
Wait a minute. Wait...
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.416
[stammers] I didn't say that.

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:40.916
- You didn't not say it either.
- Well, I...

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:41.874
Who, Buzz?

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.291
Question. Is Woody gonna
perform the wedding ceremony?

00:00:44.292 --> 00:00:47.082
I haven't thought
that far in advance, Forky.

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.916
Okay. Then why is Woody at the window?

00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:50.750
[all gasp] Woody!

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:52.582
Woody!

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.166
- Hey, everybody!
- [all] Bo!

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:56.041
Howdy, folks. Coast clear?

00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:57.374
The stage is yours, my friend.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:58.749
[all] Woody!

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.791
- It's good to s...
- Wow.

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:02.749
[♪ Western guitar plays]

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.624
Pretty cowboy.

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:06.124
Why are you wearing a dress, Woody?

00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.291
It's called a poncho, Forky.

00:01:08.292 --> 00:01:09.957
Thought I'd change it up.

00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:11.042
Yeah?

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.625
Well, Bo likes it.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.667
[sighs] It's good to be back.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:19.666
- Shiny.
- What?

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.249
- [all] Nothing.
- Love the poncho.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.666
Someone needs a brown marker.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:25.041
Wow. Look what Bonnie's done
with the place.

00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:27.999
[chuckling] It's...
She really let things go.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.999
- Oh, my.
- Oh.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.542
I see Sammy got bigger.

00:01:31.042 --> 00:01:34.457
- Uh, that's Sammy number two.
- No.

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:36.041
- [all] Yeah.
- I'll explain it.

00:01:36.042 --> 00:01:38.624
There was a Sammy number one,
and then he died.

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:39.916
- Poor Samuel.
- [beeping]

00:01:39.917 --> 00:01:42.082
- Halt. Who goes there?
- Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:44.999
Sor... Sorry. My name is Woody.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.374
I come in peace. Used to live here.

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:48.457
All right.

00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:49.541
[chuckles]

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.458
It's been too long, cowboy.

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:53.916
- How've you been?
- Ah, busy.

00:01:53.917 --> 00:01:56.624
Came here as fast as I could
after Jessie called for help.

00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:58.583
- Good thing we were in town.
- She called you?

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.917
- Yeah, I'm her deputy.
- But I'm her deputy.

00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:03.249
- Uh...
- [chuckles]

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:04.957
- That's odd.
- [chuckling] Well, well...

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.332
there must be a little mix-up here.

00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:08.624
- Well, no offense, Woody.
- Oh, none taken. None taken.

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:09.666
But she literally

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:11.499
- deputized me.
- Oh, is that so?

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.124
- Woody, look. Eyes here.
- Uh-huh.

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:15.374
- Star. Deputy. Me.
- Uh-huh.

00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.332
- No star.
- [stammers] I got you.

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.791
Star. No star.

00:02:18.792 --> 00:02:21.292
- Oh, hey, Buzz, what is that?
- What? Where?

00:02:21.792 --> 00:02:22.624
Ow.

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:23.791
- Hey. Wait...
- What?

00:02:23.792 --> 00:02:25.707
Just happy to help, Deputy.

00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:29.249
[sighs] Call me when
you're done helping, dear.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.374
[Woody] Thanks, Bo.

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:31.832
[Duke] Okay, ladies.

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:33.541
- [Bo] Girls weekend!
- Yes.

00:02:33.542 --> 00:02:35.416
<i>Un, deux, trois!</i>

00:02:35.417 --> 00:02:36.375
[horn beeps]

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:38.999
Where is Jessie, anyway?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.249
Sleepover reconnaissance.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.541
Yeah, she and Bullseye are
helping Bonnie make friends.

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:45.207
While fending off the nefarious Lilypad.

00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:47.707
It's Dolly, by the way. Glasses.

00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:49.166
Didn't you always have glasses?

00:02:49.167 --> 00:02:50.457
What? No.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:52.666
We've got it handled, cowboy.

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:53.957
As her deputy, I'm certain

00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:56.541
Jessie's resting
on a comfy pillow right now

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:58.791
making all the difference for Bonnie.

00:02:58.792 --> 00:03:01.083
[Jessie groaning, straining]

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:05.874
[groaning continues]

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:06.832
[sighs]

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:08.000
[whinnies]

00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:10.499
[scoffs] You're no help.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.416
[gasps]

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:13.416
Hey, you can help get me out of here.

00:03:13.417 --> 00:03:14.416
[summons Daffodil]

00:03:14.417 --> 00:03:16.957
Come here. Come on. Come on. Daffodil.

00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:18.499
Yeah, yeah, come over here.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.749
Come on. Come on.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.832
[gasps]

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.666
- [snorts]
- [chuckles]

00:03:22.667 --> 00:03:24.791
Nice pig. Nice pig.

00:03:24.792 --> 00:03:26.416
Stinky pig.

00:03:26.417 --> 00:03:28.374
- [screams]
- [grunts]

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.999
Hey, hey, there.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.667
[stammers] I guess you'll have to do.

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:34.624
Jimmy Dean?

00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.791
You mean, like, the... Oh, no.

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:37.832
- [squeals]
- Oh!

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:39.666
- Okay. Wow, that's your name?
- [grunting]

00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:40.749
Jimmy Dean?

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.332
Take me to the house.

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:44.749
- [squealing]
- [gasps]

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.207
Golly gee whillikers! It's working.

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:48.832
[exclaiming]

00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:50.457
Hey! Ugh! Yuck!

00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:53.042
[gasping] Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:54.457
Yes!

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:58.249
Yes. Yes, good pig. Good pig. Good--

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.207
No. No, no, no.

00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:02.249
Bad pig. Oh, wrong way, Jimmy.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.041
Oh, no, no. Wrong house, Jimmy.

00:04:05.042 --> 00:04:06.375
Wrong house. Wrong-- [grunts]

00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:08.582
[Jimmy grunting]

00:04:08.583 --> 00:04:09.666
No. [grunts]

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:11.833
[panting, strains]

00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:13.833
- [Combat Carl] Blaze?
- [gasps]

00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:15.457
[all groan]

00:04:15.458 --> 00:04:16.833
False alarm, everyone.

00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:18.416
Um...

00:04:18.417 --> 00:04:21.374
Oh, apologies. Where are
Combat Carl's manners?

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:23.332
[stammers] Welcome. Please, take a seat.

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:24.416
Oh. [chuckles]

00:04:24.417 --> 00:04:26.791
No. I've gotta get home.

00:04:26.792 --> 00:04:27.791
- No, no! Sit.
- Please, sit.

00:04:27.792 --> 00:04:29.749
- [speaks Spanish]
- Combat Carl insists.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.582
Oh. Okay.

00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:32.999
- [all clamoring]
- No, no, no!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.500
- Oh, sorry. I'm sorry.
- Any chair but that one.

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.249
Who... Who sits there?

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.499
[all] Blaze.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.499
Blaze. You mean the girl I saw
in the barn?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.541
She's your kid?

00:04:42.542 --> 00:04:44.749
[sighs] Isn't she swell?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.207
She loves her tea parties.

00:04:46.208 --> 00:04:48.749
And telling us all her secrets.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.791
That's right, Pizza With Sunglasses.

00:04:50.792 --> 00:04:52.041
To Blaze's return.

00:04:52.042 --> 00:04:53.832
[all] To Blaze's return!

00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:56.000
[sipping]

00:04:56.625 --> 00:04:57.917
Mmm. <i>Rico.</i>

00:04:58.458 --> 00:04:59.624
Ooh, hot.

00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:01.207
[smacks lips] Uh...

00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:06.083
How long has it been
since your Blaze last had tea?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.707
Things were never really the same

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:11.707
- once he arrived.
- He?

00:05:11.708 --> 00:05:14.666
Smarty Pants. Blaze's first device.

00:05:14.667 --> 00:05:16.499
- You're sitting on him.
- What?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.749
[gasps] Holy butterscotch!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:19.666
[beeps]

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:21.375
[♪ playing music]

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:23.291
<i>Why, hello there. Pick a number.</i>

00:05:23.292 --> 00:05:24.583
- Not again!
- Make it stop! Don't!

00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:27.416
- Oh, just kill me.
- Come on.

00:05:27.417 --> 00:05:28.999
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.041
- Hey, hey!
- No! Don't!

00:05:30.042 --> 00:05:32.583
This... This isn't the bathroom.

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.332
How long have I been off?

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:35.707
- Shut up, chair!
- We hate you.

00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:36.791
Turn him off.

00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:38.625
[groans] Gosh.

00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:43.041
Who's this little, old, tiny grandma lady?

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:46.041
- Gosh, what is wrong with him?
- Low batteries.

00:05:46.042 --> 00:05:47.332
[Smarty Pants groaning]

00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:48.582
Eggman?

00:05:48.583 --> 00:05:50.707
[groans] You're one of those Pond devices.

00:05:50.708 --> 00:05:51.707
- [burps]
- [groans]

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:54.166
I already have to put up with
a Lilypad back home.

00:05:54.167 --> 00:05:56.082
- Hey.
- I don't have time for this.

00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:59.583
[grunting] Your Blaze took my
horse into the house...

00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:02.957
and we gotta get back to our own kid.

00:06:02.958 --> 00:06:05.541
Wait, wait, wait, wait.
You're going inside?

00:06:05.542 --> 00:06:08.624
- Take me with you, please!
- Not a chance.

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:09.791
You need help pushing?

00:06:09.792 --> 00:06:11.541
I'm... [hiccups] ...great with pushing.

00:06:11.542 --> 00:06:12.457
PUSH!

00:06:12.458 --> 00:06:14.457
<i>You can do it. You can do it.
Like a choo-choo,</i>

00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:15.374
<i>- you can poop.
-</i> No!

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:17.791
How about you just wait here
with your friends?

00:06:17.792 --> 00:06:20.999
Spend another second with
Corporal No-Pants? [hiccups]

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.249
I'm coming with you, cowgirl.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.791
No way. Your kind's caused me
enough trouble.

00:06:24.792 --> 00:06:26.166
My kind?

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:27.832
- Take him!
- Please! Get him out of here!

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:29.249
All he's good for is chair.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.042
I am not a chair!

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:35.832
I am a potty trainer!

00:06:35.833 --> 00:06:38.042
Show some respect!

00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:41.791
Okay, listen, Raggedy Ann.
All these losers are outdoor toys.

00:06:41.792 --> 00:06:44.499
I'm the only one who's
done time inside. [hiccups]

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.457
You wanna find your horsey? Clippity-clop.

00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:49.041
I know exactly where Blaze put him, okay?

00:06:49.042 --> 00:06:53.041
You need me. You need me. You need me.

00:06:53.042 --> 00:06:54.624
YOU NEED ME!

00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:55.875
Hi.

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:58.833
[Jessie] Move. Move.

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.167
[all grunt]

00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:04.624
Hey, geez. Someone dim
the brightness out here.

00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:05.832
- Shut up.
- Would you try walking

00:07:05.833 --> 00:07:07.291
- a little less bouncy?
- Shut up.

00:07:07.292 --> 00:07:09.499
Quick. Lock the door before
they change their minds.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.583
Copy that.

00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:15.292
[♪ marching music playing]

